commit 684f7004980cae65d73e073ce6058d947b57babf
Author: root <root@LAPTOP-FVNNQNU9.localdomain>
Date:   Wed Sep 9 19:13:42 2026 +0800

    cpu: rv64: add f32 bias support to the half-precision GEMM path
    
    Extend the f16/bf16 GEMM kernel with a fused f32 bias (call_params + epilogue
    vfadd_vf before the narrow), relax the hp-path zero-bias gate, and thread the
    bias through rvv_gemm_f16 / block_ker / rvv_matmul so RNN f16 matmul hits the
    vector kernel instead of the scalar reference.

